{"unit_id":"guanhaisen__dsh-agent-browser#card-zh","repo":"guanhaisen/dsh-agent-browser","commit":"0ae65b549254e1870e49e140172177f2a2349afe","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-agent-browser 是面向 DSH Desktop 的浏览器自动化插件：它把当前会话右侧栏的浏览器接入模型工具，可读取页面文本、HTML 和可交互元素，并能导航、点击、输入、滚动、等待、截图及关闭标签。插件还支持手机、平板、桌面和自定义视口，便于检查响应式布局，并在侧栏菜单和通用设置中提供视口控制。适合在 DSH 中让模型浏览网页、操作页面或查看不同屏幕尺寸下的界面；需要 DSH Desktop，Web 客户端不支持驱动页面。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:317-330","index.js:388-410","index.js:478-535","index.js:605-613","index.js:644-660","client.js:2999-3057"]}
{"unit_id":"guanhaisen__dsh-agent-browser#card-en","repo":"guanhaisen/dsh-agent-browser","commit":"0ae65b549254e1870e49e140172177f2a2349afe","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-agent-browser connects the DSH Desktop sidebar browser to model tools for reading pages, interacting with elements, navigating, and taking screenshots. It sets phone, tablet, desktop, or custom viewports for responsive layout checks. Use it to browse pages inside DSH; it requires DSH Desktop.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:317-330","index.js:388-410","index.js:478-535","index.js:605-613","index.js:644-660","client.js:2999-3057"]}
