{"unit_id":"guanhaisen__dsh-agent-browser#feature-1","repo":"guanhaisen/dsh-agent-browser","commit":"0ae65b549254e1870e49e140172177f2a2349afe","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-agent-browser 的功能「读取网页」：模型可获取当前标签的地址、标题、可见文本、HTML 或交互元素。调用 browser_read 选择 text、html 或 elements 模式，并可把元素引用用于后续操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:317-386","client.js:2288-2305"]}
{"unit_id":"guanhaisen__dsh-agent-browser#feature-2","repo":"guanhaisen/dsh-agent-browser","commit":"0ae65b549254e1870e49e140172177f2a2349afe","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-agent-browser 的功能「操作网页」：模型可点击、输入、按键、滚动、选择选项、重载页面或等待元素状态。调用 browser_act，使用 browser_read 返回的引用或 CSS 选择器指定目标。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:388-477","client.js:2288-2350"]}
{"unit_id":"guanhaisen__dsh-agent-browser#feature-3","repo":"guanhaisen/dsh-agent-browser","commit":"0ae65b549254e1870e49e140172177f2a2349afe","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-agent-browser 的功能「响应式视口」：为浏览器标签设置自动、手机、平板、桌面或自定义尺寸，页面会按实际视口重新布局。调用 browser_viewport 选择预设，也可在截图时一并指定尺寸。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:478-535","index.js:644-714","client.js:2999-3057"]}
{"unit_id":"guanhaisen__dsh-agent-browser#feature-4","repo":"guanhaisen/dsh-agent-browser","commit":"0ae65b549254e1870e49e140172177f2a2349afe","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-agent-browser 的功能「网页截图」：捕获当前浏览器视口并将图像交给模型查看，也可先应用手机、平板、桌面或自定义尺寸。调用 browser_screenshot，可用于检查视觉布局或图表。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:478-604","client.js:2288-2305"]}
{"unit_id":"guanhaisen__dsh-agent-browser#feature-5","repo":"guanhaisen/dsh-agent-browser","commit":"0ae65b549254e1870e49e140172177f2a2349afe","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-agent-browser 的功能「浏览器标签管理」：列出当前会话的侧栏浏览器标签及标题、地址和加载状态，也可以关闭指定标签。先调用 browser_tabs 获取 tabId，再用 browser_close 清理标签。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:265-313","index.js:715-769"]}
